{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52031","headline":"山家夏日九首 三 · 王绩","name":"山家夏日九首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山中旧可安，无处不盘桓。\n岭澁攀藤易，岩崎策杖难。\n药供无限食，石起自然坛。\n树密檐偏冷，泉深阶镇寒。\n松根聊入酿，竹实试调丹。\n孔淳书数帙，朝朝还自看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}